!*.tfvars.example
# The spec keeps the reviewed ami_id in envs/lab/lab.tfvars: ami.yml bumps it in
# a PR and rollback is `git revert`. It holds no secrets, so it is committed.
!terraform/envs/lab/lab.tfvars
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
tfplan
*.tfplan
plan.txt

